<title>ITALY: TIM sees 1997 Q1 sales up 29 percent.</title>
<headline>TIM sees 1997 Q1 sales up 29 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's state-controlled mobile phone group Telecom Italia Mobile (TIM) said on Friday its first quarter 1997 sales rose 29 percent to around two trillion lire, while its return on sales was touching 30 percent.  </p>
<p>The company is Europe's largest mobile phone group.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
